 182:./Application/Funtion/Usart/ToolingCheck.c ****             ModbusReg[REG_VERSION_FLAG][1] = 0xFF;
 183:./Application/Funtion/Usart/ToolingCheck.c ****         }
 184:./Application/Funtion/Usart/ToolingCheck.c ****     }
 185:./Application/Funtion/Usart/ToolingCheck.c **** 
 186:./Application/Funtion/Usart/ToolingCheck.c ****     //3. 如果flag = 1，从寄存器写入外部存储然后再读取
 187:./Application/Funtion/Usart/ToolingCheck.c ****     else if (version_flag == 1)
